<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SUPERSPORT SERIES SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Supersport Series</p>
<p>cricket matches which ended on Monday:</p>
<p>In Cape Town: Western Province 433-3 declared and 222 (Craig</p>
<p>Matthews 64, Brian McMillan 63), Natal 359 and 55-1. Rain -</p>
<p>match abandoned as a draw.</p>
<p>In Bloemfontein: Free State beat Eastern Province by 74</p>
<p>runs. Free State 178 and 275, Eastern Province 198 and 181.</p>
<p>In Centurion: Transvaal 201-6 declared and 71-1, Northern</p>
<p>Transvaal 164 (Roy Pienaar 55, Wayne Kidwell 4-58). Rain - match</p>
<p>abandoned as a draw.</p>
</text>
